  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Echoing Green (EG) COVID 19 - Girls Excel</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to provide seed capital to Delphine Konda to produce and distribute approximately 2,000 hand sanitizers to women and girls in three vulnerable communities in Limbe, Cameroon. This distribution will be accompanied by a door-to-door educational outreach initiative to sensitize the communities on the need to take precautions to decrease the likelihood of contacting and spreading the virus. This outreach would use the local language to ensure comprehension. Girls Excel will expand their social media strategy and provide updates based on field intel.</narrative>
  </description>
